\tag{RC.2}
\]

Every C65 rattler lies in the strict interior of `R`.

If `nu` is the odd cycle length of the full diameter graph, equivalently the number of defining vertices/arcs of the Reinhardt Reuleaux polygon, then

\[
\boxed{
